  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Prerequisite Region - Impossible Lands Your apprenticeship in one
    of Oenopion's unorthodox arcane and alchemical academies instilled in you a deep
    reservoir of mostly reliable esoteric knowledge, not to mention a deep resentment
    born of countless hours spent mucking ooze pens and feeding helpless creatures
    to ravenous, belching jellies and gelatinous puddings. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Constitution or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Crafting skill and the Ooze Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dubious
    Knowledge] skill feat.
